python-pureapk (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 1.0.1: Documentation enhancements, PyPI rendering fixes.
  * Added dedicated documentation for modifying, modding, and re-signing existing APKs without Java.
  * Fixed Russian documentation link on PyPI project page.
  * Added cache-busting to badges for instant CDN updates.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:05:00 +0000

python-pureapk (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 1.0.0: First stable major production release.
  * Added 16KB page alignment support for Android 15 (Android tag 0xd935) and zipalign CLI.
  * Added Android Wheels (.whl) inspection, ABI auto-detection, and native unpacking.
  * Added Cloud Cython / Android NDK CI generator (pureapk init-ci).
  * Added Chinese Android stores multi-channel packaging support (--channel).
  * Added multi-store release builders: Google Play (.aab), Apple App Store (.ipa), Microsoft Store (.msix).
  * 100% test pass rate across 54 GitHub Actions CI matrix environments.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 18:15:00 +0000

python-pureapk (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 0.1.1: Complete zero-dependency pure Python Android APK engine.
  * Added first-class toolchain support for Kivy, Pygame, Flet, BeeWare (Toga), Ren'Py, and WebView.
  * Added multi-store release builders: Google Play (.aab), Apple App Store (.ipa), Microsoft Store (.msix).
  * Added generate-keystore subcommand for production release signing.
  * 100% test pass rate across 54 GitHub Actions CI matrix environments.

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000

